== Effects ==
* Opens {{R|Secret Room}}s and {{R|Super Secret Room}}s automatically.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|a+nr}} When in {{s|The Void}}, the entrances are not automatically opened if the room is not yet cleared. Re-entering the room once enemies are killed and/or {{E|Pressure Plate}}s pressed will open the doors normally.{{dlc-}}

